  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the financing of green and climate resilient infrastructures in northern Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Blending with AFD. The general objectives of the Project are to (i) support NADB in the financing of projects with high impact in terms of mitigation and adaptation to climate change, to contribute to Mexico&#xbf;s NDC, as well as sustainable economic growth and (ii) provide technical assistance to support NADB&#xbf;s and their project sponsors&#xbf; develop and strengthen monitoring and reporting activities, beyond advancing the investments financed by the line of credit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The main expected impacts of the project are to contribute to the following:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Smart sustainable and inclusive economic and social development and growth (Proportion of population using safely managed drinking water services and proportion of population using safely managed sanitation services) ; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Effective climate resilient low-carbon economy and society (Renewable energy share in the total final energy consumption ; Proportion of population that has convenient access to public transport, by sex, age and persons with disabilities). &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
